ng teams rely on every day, and gained hands-on experience in go-to-market engineering, one of the hottest roles on the market right now!</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will also see first-hand how a modern B2B start-up operates day to day, with AI built into its workflows.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>This role is for you</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You combine technical thinking with commercial curiosity: perhaps you studied engineering and want to understand how companies sell, or you have discovered a passion for the commercial side of start-ups.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are keen to work in a fast-paced environment and to grow alongside a high-growth start-up.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You bring the drive to learn quickly, a sharp analytical mind and the ambition to take on real responsibility from your first weeks. You collaborate well, ask questions without hesitation and are happy to get your hands dirty.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You use AI as more than a better search engine. You have built your own automations, workflows or tools, and can explain what you shipped and what came of it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are fluent in both German and English. Much of our outbound targets buyers in the DACH region, while the company operates in English.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You stand out if you have built something entrepreneurial during your studies, be it a side project, a student society or a small business.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have first experience in GTM engineering, sales operations or automation (this is a big advantage but <u>not a requirement</u>!)</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Your performance objectives</h2><h3>🧬 Run outbound campaigns</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Deliver multichannel campaigns end to end.</strong> Build target lists, source and enrich the right contacts, and write the messaging in German and English.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Go where coverage is thin.</strong> Your campaigns will go wherever our sellers need the most support or wherever there is an opportunity worth pursuing, starting with DACH and extending to the rest of Europe and North America. Take on event campaigns, new regions and opportunistic plays, and turn them around to contribute to our pipeline.</p></li></ul><h3>🌀 Build signals and tooling</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ship signals.</strong> Build plugins or scrapers that generate high-intent leads for our sellers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Process scaling.</strong> Transform website engagement into automated outbound triggers and create repeatable playbooks.</p></li></ul><h3>⚙️ Build automations</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Remove manual work.</strong> Automate the repetitive manual tasks our revenue teams deal with day to day.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Challenge what exists.</strong> Get to know the systems we have built, then tell us where they fall short and help improve them.</p></li></ul><h3>💶 Unblock the sales team</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Understand what sales reps need.</strong> Work closely with our AEs and BDRs, get to know their accounts and processes, and remove the friction that slows them down.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Close the loop.</strong> Feed what you learn from replies and campaign results back to sales and marketing.</p></li></ul><h3>🗂 Own the data</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own enrichment and imports.</strong> Take responsibility for account enrichment and every data import into HubSpot on contact, company and lead level.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Keep data 