rket stakeholders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead campaign calls, share updates and keep everyone aligned.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring ideas, recommendations and solutions to the table.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build trust through great communication and consistent delivery.</p></li></ul><h3>Find and Work With Amazing Creators</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Discover and cast creators who are the right fit for each product, audience and brief.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build high-quality creator shortlists across multiple campaigns.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage outreach, briefing, negotiations, contracting and content delivery.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Oversee usage rights, advertising disclosures and creator approvals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use performance insights to make your next casting list even better.</p></li></ul><h3>Get Creative With Technology</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use Kyra's platform to manage campaigns from start to finish.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Monitor CPV, reach, engagement and other key performance metrics.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use AI tools to make creator discovery, research, analysis and campaign management more efficient.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keep campaign information accurate and up to date so everyone has visibility.</p></li></ul><h2>⚡ How We Work</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We move quickly, work collaboratively and care about doing great work.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">With multiple campaigns running at once, staying organised, taking ownership and communicating clearly makes a huge difference.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Here's what that looks like in practice:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">New briefs are picked up within 24 hours, with creator discovery and 