&lt;li&gt;Monitor weekly channel performance against business plans, YoY, and monthly activation, reactivation, and referral targets to optimize media spend and ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage spend pacing, reallocations, discount structures, promotional campaign execution, and post-release testing and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steer agency, affiliate, SEO, and partner relationships, ensuring high-quality, brand-aligned creative assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own CRO, merchandising, layout, and audits across web and app menus and product pages to improve conversion and maintain accurate customer content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a placement calendar tracking digital campaign opportunities such as banners, in-menu messaging, and newsletter highlights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and scope new channels, commercial models, and growth initiatives, modeling unit economics to expand the addressable market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end go-to-market campaigns and strategies for new products, channels, features, and partnership launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-10+ years of experience in growth ecommerce marketing, ideally in digital subscription or D2C food and beverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving revenue growth, managing promotional calendars, and exceeding targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data analytics capability, with experience building models, performance dashboards, and managing media attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of conversion rate optimization, user journeys, digital copywriting, and UX best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating with CRM, creative, and international cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
