&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/databricks/srmanager-field-engineering-digital-natives-emerging-enterprise-france-paris-156711","tags":["Field Engineering - Other"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1793818528},{"slug":"ai-forward-deployed-engineer-france-paris-400255","company_name":"databricks","title":"AI Forward Deployed Engineer - France","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer - FDE (Forward Deployed Engineer)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Req ID: CSQ427R334&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome remote applicants located near our offices. Preferred locations: Paris, France. Remote location for candidates to be based in the France region only (not remote from any other country)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Forward Deployed Engineering (AI FDE) team is a highly specialised customer-facing AI team at Databricks. We deliver professional services engagements to help our customers build and productionize first-of-its-kind AI applications. We work cross-functionally to shape long-term strategic priorities and initiatives alongside engineering, product, and developer relations, as well as support internal subject matter expert (SME) teams. We view our team as an ensemble: we look for individuals with strong, unique specialisations to improve the overall strength of the team. This team is the right fit for you if you love working with customers, teammates, and fueling your curiosity for the latest trends in GenAI, LLMOps, and ML more broadly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to: Senior Manager - AI FDE, EMEA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop cutting-edge GenAI solutions, incorporating the latest techniques from &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.databricks.com/blog/category/databricks-ai?categories=databricks-ai%2Cai-research%2Cai-engineering&quot;&gt;Databricks AI research&lt;/a&gt; to solve customer problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own production rollouts of consumer and internally facing GenAI applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted technical advisor to customers across a variety of domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present at conferences such as Data + AI Summit, recognized as a thought leader internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with the product and engineering teams to influence priorities and shape the product roadmap&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Min 4 years&#39; experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building GenAI applications, including RAG, multi-agent systems, Text2SQL, fine-tuning, etc., with tools such as HuggingFace, LangChain, and DSPy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in deploying production-grade GenAI applications, including evaluation and optimisations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive years of hands-on industry data science experience, leveraging common machine learning and data science tools, i.e. pandas, scikit-learn, PyTorch, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building production-grade machine learning deployments on AWS, Azure, or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate degree in a quantitative discipline (Computer Science, Engineering, Statistics, Operations Research, etc.) or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating and/or teaching technical concepts to non-technical and technical audiences alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for collaboration, life-long learning, and driving business value through AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Preferred] Experience using the Databricks Intelligence Platform and Apache Spark™ to process large-scale distributed datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel once every 4-8 weeks to see customers (as needed)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/databricks/ai-forward-deployed-engineer-france-paris-400255","tags":["Professional Services Operations"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1793818528},{"slug":"implementation-planning-director-f-h-cdi-paris-91279","company_name":"wppmedia","title":"Implementation Planning Director - F/H - CDI","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;For clarity and accessibility, we have chosen not to use gender-neutral or inclusive writing conventions in our communications. WPP Media is firmly committed to diversity: we value inclusion and equality, considering all candidates regardless of gender identity, ethnic origin, or religion. All our positions are also open to people with disabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;WPP is a creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build a better future for our people, our planet, our clients, and our communities. For more information, visit &lt;a id=&quot;OWA519da216-b9bf-0b2e-cb31-6bf014a89cd1&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://wpp.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s global media network. In a world where media is omnipresent, we bring together the best platform, the best talent, and the best partners to develop the most innovative solutions, delivering unparalleled growth for our clients. For more information, visit &lt;a id=&quot;OWA26449dfe-1f3a-ebd7-2fa0-f1458cc16da5&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://wppmedia.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It is through this synergy that we deliver truly exceptional experiences, for both our clients and our internal teams. To succeed in this role, it is crucial to embody the core values that unite WPP and WPP Media:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by fostering collective leadership that inspires truly transformative creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by finding the perfect balance between the fulfillment of our people and the satisfaction of our clients, all built on mutual trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Optimism&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by actively stimulating growth and development to mobilize our entire organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;L’Oréal International Distribution (LID) is one of our flagship global media accounts, delivering full-funnel media planning and activation across 30+ markets in Europe, MENA, and Sub-Saharan Africa. Spanning five iconic L’Oréal divisions—Luxe, Consumer Products Division (CPD), L’Oréal Dermatological Beauty (LDB), Professional Products Division (PPD), and Dragon—the account is entering an ambitious growth phase, expanded scope across Amazon Ads and CPD, and fast-growing African markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;To sit directly alongside the client leadership, the core planning function is relocating from London to Paris.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As Implementation Planning Director, you will be the operational anchor and strategic owner of every media plan across all five divisions. You will not simply inherit a structure—you will build, shape, and lead the new Paris-based planning hub while orchestrating scaled activation via our offshore specialist desks in Delhi.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;1. End-to-End Planning Ownership &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Master the Account Plan:&lt;/span&gt; Own end-to-end media implementation planning across all 30 markets and 5 divisions, ensuring plans translate overarching brand strategy into flawless execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lead Annual &amp;amp; Quarterly Prioritisation:&lt;/span&gt; Drive the critical January client prioritisation and Tier 1 campaign slot allocations, establishing clear campaign tiering, budgets, and SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Orchestrate Channel Specialists:&lt;/span&gt; Steer briefs and execution across digital, offline, and emerging channels, working in lockstep with the &lt;span&gt;Amazon Ads Director&lt;/span&gt;, Delhi offshore activation hubs (Programmatic, Social, Amazon Search), and central strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quality Assurance &amp;amp; Rigour:&lt;/span&gt; Safeguard delivery standards through high-stakes periods, ensuring flawless in-market execution, budget pacing, and post-campaign reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;2. Client Partnership &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Senior Client Counsel: Partner daily with key client leaders to provide trusted, proactive planning consultation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Expectation &amp;amp; Scope Management:&lt;/span&gt; Own client relationships up to Procurement and Marketing Director levels. Confidently establish boundaries, negotiate priorities, and align expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Close Internal Partnership: Collaborate daily on-site with the&amp;nbsp;Client Leadership in Paris to maintain unified agency leadership and client health.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;3. Team Leadership &amp;amp; Hub Building&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build &amp;amp; Scale the Paris Hub: Lead the onboarding, and mentoring of incoming Paris-based Planning Managers, setting team culture and best-in-class planning workflows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Offshore Hub Integration: Establish efficient, collaborative, and accountable working rhythms with our specialist activation leads in Delhi.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;4. Cross-Functional Integration &amp;amp; Commercial Stewardship&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Holistic Solutions:&lt;/span&gt; Bridge implementation planning with Strategy, Commerce, Analytics, and Finance to deliver connected consumer journeys and commercial value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Financial Governance:&lt;/span&gt; Oversee accurate budget tracking, variance management, and financial reconciliations across multi-currency, multi-market plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Non-Negotiable Requirements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;8+ years of media planning experience&lt;/span&gt; within a leading media agency, with at least &lt;span&gt;3+ years leading multi-market / international accounts&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;End-to-End Planning Mastery:&lt;/span&gt; Proven track record running the entire lifecycle: brief deconstruction, multi-channel architecture, offshore/specialist briefing, client sign-off, QA, and advanced reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Senior Client Ownership:&lt;/span&gt; Demonstrated authority managing and holding boundaries with Marketing Directors, Division Heads, and Procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Prioritisation &amp;amp; Backbone:&lt;/span&gt; High level of planning judgement—comfortable deciding which campaigns warrant senior attention and clearly communicating trade-offs to senior clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/span&gt; Experience managing planners/associate directors and leading through structural change or hub transitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Languages &amp;amp; Location:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span&gt;Fluent English&lt;/span&gt; is mandatory. Must be currently &lt;span&gt;based in Paris or actively relocating&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Preferred &amp;amp; Functional Skills&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Bilingual English / French:&lt;/span&gt; A significant asset given daily proximity to the Paris-based client team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Channel Breadth:&lt;/span&gt; Strong literacy across Digital Performance, Brand Media, Offline/Local channels, and &lt;span&gt;Amazon Ads / Retail Media&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Category Familiarity:&lt;/span&gt; Experience in Beauty, FMCG, or Luxury is advantageous, though proven multi-market operational rigour is our primary criterion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Shape, Don&#39;t Just Inherit:&lt;/span&gt; You are architecting a new Paris hub from the ground up on one of the world&#39;s most prestigious beauty accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Scale &amp;amp; Momentum: Work with a rapidly expanding media budget across 30 dynamic markets spanning Europe, the Middle East, and Sub-Saharan Africa.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Senior Visibility:&lt;/span&gt; Direct proximity to global client decision-makers combined with the backing of scaled, mature offshore execution teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media and its Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Our commitment to shaping the future of media is manifested by active support for the professional development of our talents, helping them reach their full potential. This approach is accompanied by a responsible vision in our media investment strategies, thus reflecting our dual priority: valuing our employees while adopting sustainable practices in our sector. WPP Media employees have privileged access to WPP Media&#39;s and WPP&#39;s international networks, allowing them to develop their passions, expand their professional network, and stay at the forefront of innovations in marketing and advertising.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We have vast and varied resources available to our employees; our company actively cultivates the inclusion of talents from all backgrounds. The successes and expertise of the teams are regularly highlighted during unifying events that also punctuate key moments of the year, thus strengthening our collaborative and diverse corporate culture.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;up to 2 days per week and 2 full weeks to be taken twice a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two additional days off offered&lt;/strong&gt;, including Whit Monday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional leave days&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;based on seniority in 5-year increments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 additional remote work days per month&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for employees suffering from endometriosis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disability policy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;3 paid authorized absence days per year, access to Chèques Emploi Service Universel (CESU), and specific support for employees with a RQTH (Recognition of Disabled Worker Status).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solidarity missions&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;possible via the &quot;We care and we act&quot; program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview with the recruitment team:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A first phone or video conference interview with a member of our recruitment team to review your background, discuss your experience with European campaign management and analytics, and address your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational interview:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;An interview with the Luxury Client Team lead to assess your technical, analytical, and management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Case study:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A practical case study focused on cross-media campaign analysis and strategy within the European market, followed by a debriefing session.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are committed to making this process as fast and efficient as possible, and to maintaining open and transparent communication throughout.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;WPP Media guarantees equal opportunities and considers all candidates without discrimination or consideration of particular characteristics. We are committed to cultivating an environment of respect where everyone feels at home and benefits from the same opportunities for professional development.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
