"slug":"teamleider-electromagnetic-warfare-amsterdam-87926","company_name":"Koninklijk Nederlands Lucht- en Ruimtevaartcentrum","title":"Teamleider Electromagnetic Warfare (m/v/x)","description":"<p><span style="font-size:1.1em">Ben jij die ambitieuze Teamleider / R&amp;D engineer die graag helpt om civiele en militaire vliegtuigen veilig, duurzaam en competitief te laten vliegen? Wil jij jezelf verder ontwikkelen en word je enthousiast van techniek, innovatie en duurzaamheid? Wij zijn op zoek naar een teamleider voor de afdeling.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>Wat ga je doen?</h4><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">In een wereld waarin lucht- en ruimtevaartsystemen steeds complexer worden, is het belangrijk om innovatieve oplossingen te ontwikkelen om de veiligheid en efficiëntie te garanderen. Binnen NLR werken we aan de ontwikkeling van geavanceerde aerospace systemen. We maken hierbij gebruik van software modelering en simulatie om het gedrag van complexe systemen te begrijpen en te optimaliseren.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Onze expertise in hardware testen en operationele ondersteuning (OPS) zorgt ervoor dat onze oplossingen niet alleen theoretisch solide zijn, maar ook praktisch toepasbaar en robuust.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">De belangstelling voor Electromagnetic Warfare (EW) neemt toe, met de noodzaak om onze lucht- en ruimtevaartsystemen te beschermen tegen elektromagnetische bedreigingen. We zoeken hierom een teamleider binnen onze nieuwe afdeling Aerospace Systems Electronic Warfare (ASEW)</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Als teamleider EW zal je leiding geven aan een team van professionals met expertise in het ontwerp, de ontwikkeling en het testen van aerospace systemen met focus op Electronic Warfare.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Binnen onze nieuwe afdeling Aerospace Systems Electromagnetic Warfare zoeken wij een ervaren en gedreven Teamleider om ons team te leiden en te inspireren. De afdeling is gericht op het ontwikkelen van innovatieve oplossingen voor Electromagnetic Warfare (EW) en heeft als doel om de Nederlandse en internationale lucht- en ruimtevaartindustrie te ondersteunen.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Als Teamleider binnen onze afdeling ASEW ben je verantwoordelijk voor het leiden en ontwikkelen van een team van specialisten op het gebied van EW. Je werkt nauw samen met de Afdelingsmanager en andere teams binnen NLR om onze doelen te bereiken.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">In afstemming met de Afdelingsmanager ASEW zal je één van de twee Electromagnetic Warfare kennisgebied overzien, namelijk Electronic Warfare Modelling and Simulation of Electronic Warfare Analyses.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">In de rol van teamleider blijf je actief en inhoudelijk betrokken bij het uitvoeren van projecten en krijg je de coördinatie over een team van technische collega’s en het verder ontwikkelen en uitbouwen van de faciliteiten waarvoor ASEW verantwoordelijk is. Je bent dus zowel een teamleider als een R&amp;D Engineer.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal"><strong>Als teamleider …</strong></p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Als teamleider bied jij het team alles wat nodig is om de werkzaamheden van jouw team succesvol te laten verlopen. Je bent de directe leidinggevende van betreffende collega’s en draagt ook de HR-verantwoordelijkheid. Je coacht, stuurt, geeft én vraagt feedback en je pakt de leiding wanneer nodig.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Je stelt hen op deze wijze in staat om optimaal aan de projecten te werken en faciliteer jij hen waar nodig. Je zorgt voor het versterken van de kennispositie van het werkgebied en de realisatie van de werkzaamheden/opdrachten voor interne en externe stakeholders.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Je hebt een open en enthousiasmerende stijl van leidinggeven. Je collega’s voelen zich vrij en gesteund en kunnen zichzelf goed ontwikkelen. Er wordt een goede teamspirit ervaren. Je zorgt voor een goede aansluiting van het werkgebied bij de rest van ASEW en voor het zoeken van synergie met andere afdelingen binnen flight test en certificatie. Je versterkt de samenwerkingsrelaties gericht op het verder volwassen laten worden van het team.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal"><strong>Als R&amp;D Engineer…</strong></p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Als R&amp;D engineer EW werk je mee aan het veiliger, duurzamer en competitiever maken van de militaire en civiele luchtvaart. Je werkt aan vliegtuigen, helikopters en onbemande vliegende systemen.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Je ondersteunt onze binnen- en buitenlandse opdrachtgevers bij het bereiken van hun doelen. Je voert testen uit, genereerd modellen en analyseert resultaten.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">In de rol van R&amp;D engineer, trek of draag je inhoudelijk bij aan projectvoorstellen voor bijvoorbeeld betaalde projecten in opdracht van een (externe) stakeholder. Dit kunnen ook onderzoeksvoorstellen zijn voor bijvoorbeeld defensie onderzoeks-calls.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal"><u>Verantwoordelijkheden</u></p><ul><li><p>Leiden en ontwikkelen van een team van specialisten op het gebied van EW;</p></li><li><p>Samenwerken met de Afdelingsmanager ASEW en andere teams binnen NLR om onze doelen te bereiken;</p></li><li><p>Overzien van een kennisgebied (Electronic Warfare Modelling and Simulation of Electronic Warfare Analyses) waarmee je samen met de Afdelingsmanager tot strategische doelen van het team komt;</p></li><li><p>Inspireren en motiveren van teamleden om hun beste werk te leveren;</p></li><li><p>Coördineren van projecten en activiteiten om de doelen van de afdeling te bereiken.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>Wat breng je mee?</h4><ul><li><p>Een afgeronde WO master in een relevante discipline (bijv. lucht- en ruimtevaarttechniek, elektrotechniek, informatica);</p></li><li><p>Tenminste 3 jaar ervaring in een leidinggevende functie, bij voorkeur in de lucht- en ruimtevaartindustrie;</p></li><li><p>Aantoonbare kennis en ervaring op het gebied van EW;</p></li><li><p>Uitstekende communicatieve vaardigheden in zowel het Nederlands als het Engels (tenminste op C1 niveau);</p></li><li><p>Sterke leiderschaps- en coachingsvaardigheden;</p></li><li><p>In staat om een team te inspireren en te motiveren om hun beste werk te leveren.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><h4>Wat bieden wij jou?</h4><p style="text-align:start;">Werken bij NLR, betekent werken in een nationale en internationale hightech omgeving. Samenwerken en betrokkenheid staan bij ons hoog in vaandel. Door jou vrijheid en eigen verantwoordelijkheid te geven, ben jij het best in staat om tot baanbrekende innovaties te komen. Wil jij jezelf vakinhoudelijk én op persoonlijk vlak ontwikkelen? Ook dat kan bij NLR als lerende organisatie, met daarnaast een opleidingsbudget, een mentor, interne coaches en goede contacten met mbo’s, hbo’s en universiteiten.<br><br>Naast dit alles bieden wij jou:</p><ul><li><p>De kans om bij te dragen aan complexe en maatschappelijk relevante vraagstukken;</p></li><li><p>Voldoende vakantie- en ATV-dagen (in totaal 45 bij fulltime dienstverband) voor een goede werk-privébalans;</p></li><li><p>Een eindejaarsuitkering van 8%;</p></li><li><p>Een tegemoetkoming in jouw zorgkosten;</p></li><li><p>Extra betaald ouderschapsverlof;</p></li><li><p style="text-align:start;">De mogelijkheid om jezelf te ontwikkelen met opleidingen en cursussen die passen bij jouw ambities.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>Jouw nieuwe werkomgeving</h4><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Electromagnetic Warfare is een nieuwe afdeling binnen Aerospace systems en is voort gekomen uit de afdeling Defence Operations. Je zult de leidinggevende zijn van een team enthousiaste en gedreven professionals. Hierbij zul je nauw samenwerken met andere NLR afdelingen, in het bijzonder de afdeling waaruit ASEW voortgekomen is. De werkzaamheden zijn direct gerelateerd aan Defensie, weerbaarheid en de verdediging van Nederland en de Nederlandse krijgsmacht.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Je werkt vanuit onze locatie in Amsterdam en zult veel contact met collega's en partners binnen en buiten NLR.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>Wat betekent werken bij NLR?</h4><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5A5F72">Koninklijke NLR is al ruim 100 jaar een kennisorganisatie met de wil en ambitie om te vernieuwen. Vanuit die drijfveer maken wij de wereld van lucht- en ruimtevaart veiliger, duurzamer, efficiënter en effectiever en staan wij voor baanbrekende innovaties.<br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5A5F72">Bij ons werken meer dan 1000 gedreven professionals, van vliegtuigbouwkundigen tot psychologen en van wiskundigen tot applicatiedeskundigen. NLR staat voor een inclusieve en diverse organisatie waar iedereen zich welkom, veilig, gewaardeerd en gerespecteerd voelt.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>Wil jij meer weten?</h4><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><br><span style="color:#1A1F24">Bel of mail dan met Frank Bax (recruiter) via 0615676915 of </span><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- style="color:#1A1F24">.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yE9A1H8e3cg"><span style="color:#5A5F72">Onze collega’s vertellen jou graag</span></a><span style="color:#5A5F72">&nbsp;hoe het is om bij NLR te werken. Vergeet trouwens ook niet eens een kijkje op onze socials te nemen zoals ons&nbsp;</span><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.youtube.com/@NLRmedia"><span style="color:#5A5F72">YouTube kanaal</span></a><span style="color:#5A5F72">.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>Solliciteren?</h4><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5A5F72">Mooi, we zijn benieuwd naar jou! Stuur je motivatiebrief en CV via de ‘Solliciteren’ button.</span></p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">De teamleider is een parttime functie.</p><p class="freehtmlparagraphnormal">Een assessment maakt deel uit van de procedure.&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#5A5F72">Een positieve uitkomst van een veiligheidsonderzoek (VGB) is een voorwaarde voor indiensttreding. Meer informatie daarover lees je op de website van de MIVD.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><em><span style="color:#5A5F72">Acquisitie wordt niet op prijs gesteld!</span></em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/koninklijk-nederlands-lucht-en-ruimtevaartcentrum/teamleider-electromagnetic-warfare-amsterdam-87926","tags":["Aerospace Systems"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Nederland","created_at":1793795489},{"slug":"junior-international-sales-business-development-representative-dach-market-utrecht-25001","company_name":"Securance","title":"Junior International Sales & Business Development Representative – DACH Market","description":"<h2>Empowering organizations in IT risk management</h2><p>Securance helps organizations build resilience and security, enabling them to provide assurance to stakeholders on IT risk management and cybersecurity. Based in Utrecht, the team works to structurally improve security for clients operating in the DACH market.</p><h2>Your responsibilities<strong>Junior International Sales & Partnership Representative – DACH Market</strong></h2><p><strong>Full-time Graduate Position / Part-time Working Student</strong></p><p>📍 Utrecht, The Netherlands<br>🌍 International Sales & Marketing Team<br>🇩🇪 DACH Market – Germany, Austria & Switzerland</p><p><strong>Your market is DACH. Your team is international. Your career starts in Utrecht.</strong></p><p>Are you a German-speaking student or recent graduate looking for an exciting start to your international career?</p><p>Would you like to work with colleagues from different countries, build business relationships, visit industry events and learn what professional B2B sales and partnership management are really about?</p><p><strong>Welcome to Securance!</strong></p><p>We are looking for an enthusiastic Junior International Sales & Partnership Representative to join our international Sales & Marketing team in Utrecht, the Netherlands.</p><p>Whether you're finishing your studies or have recently graduated, we offer you the opportunity to develop your commercial skills, build an international network and gain hands-on experience in business development.</p><p><strong>One team. Many nationalities. Different markets.</strong></p><p>At Securance, international collaboration isn't just something we talk about. It's how we work every day.</p><p>Our sales team brings together colleagues from different countries and cultural backgrounds. Each team member focuses on developing business in their own home market, combining local knowledge and language skills with the strength of an international organization.</p><p>We work side by side in Utrecht, sharing experiences, exchanging ideas and supporting each other.</p><p>As our German-speaking representative, you'll focus on developing our business and partnerships across the DACH region.</p><p>You'll also work closely with our colleagues in Germany, travelling there regularly when needed to collaborate with the local team, meet partners, attend events and support commercial opportunities.</p><p><strong>Your home base is Utrecht, but your professional network will extend across borders.</strong></p><p><strong>Learn Consultative Sales and Partnership Management from experienced professionals</strong></p><p>At Securance, we believe successful business development starts with understanding people, their organizations and their challenges.</p><p>We don't focus on simply pushing products or closing quick deals. Instead, we practice <strong>Consultative Sales</strong>: asking the right questions, understanding customer needs, identifying opportunities and developing solutions that create long-term value.</p><p>You'll also learn how to build and manage strategic business partnerships, develop professional networks and turn relationships into meaningful commercial opportunities.</p><p>Our experienced and innovative team will coach you, involve you in real business activities and help you develop your own professional approach.</p><p>We don't expect you to know everything when you join. We expect you to be curious, motivated and eager to learn.</p><p><strong>Our ambition is to help you become genuinely good at professional B2B sales, business development and partnership management.</strong></p><p><strong>What will you be doing?</strong></p><p>As part of our international team, you will:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Business Development:</strong> Identify potential customers, new business opportunities and commercial prospects in the DACH region.</p></li><li><p><strong>Consultative Sales:</strong> Connect with decision-makers, understand their challenges and learn how to develop valuable business solutions.</p></li><li><p><strong>Partnership Management:</strong> Help build, develop and maintain relationships with business partners, referral partners and other relevant organizations.</p></li><li><p><strong>Events & Networking:</strong> Attend industry conferences, networking events, trade fairs and business meetings to represent Securance and expand our professional network.</p></li><li><p><strong>International Collaboration:</strong> Work closely with your international colleagues in Utrecht and regularly visit Germany to collaborate with the German team when needed.</p></li><li><p><strong>Relationship Management:</strong> Support the development of long-term relationships with customers and partners.</p></li><li><p><strong>Sales & Marketing:</strong> Contribute to commercial campaigns, market research, lead generation and international business development initiatives.</p></li><li><p><strong>Market Development:</strong> Gradually take greater ownership of commercial activities and partnership opportunities in your market.</p></li></ul><p>From day one, you'll be involved in real business activities, supported by experienced colleagues.</p><p><strong>Who are we looking for?</strong></p><p>We're looking for someone with potential, personality and a strong willingness to learn.</p><p>You:</p><ul><li><p>Are in the final year of your studies or have recently graduated.</p></li><li><p>Speak German at native or near-native level and understand the German-speaking business environment.</p></li><li><p>Have good English communication skills, as English is our international working language.</p></li><li><p>Live in the Netherlands or are willing to relocate to the Utrecht area.</p></li><li><p>Enjoy meeting people, networking and building professional relationships.</p></li><li><p>Are curious, proactive, enthusiastic and commercially minded.</p></li><li><p>Enjoy working with colleagues from different nationalities and cultures.</p></li><li><p>Are interested in B2B sales, business development and partnership management.</p></li><li><p>Are comfortable attending business events and travelling to Germany regularly when required.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Previous sales experience is not required. Your attitude, motivation and willingness to learn matter much more.</strong></p><p><strong>What can you expect from Securance?</strong></p><p><strong>A genuinely international workplace</strong></p><p>Work alongside colleagues from different countries, each bringing their own perspectives, experience and market knowledge.</p><p><strong>Excellent professional development</strong></p><p>Receive practical training, personal coaching and guidance from experienced sales and business development professionals.</p><p><strong>International exposure and travel</strong></p><p>Visit Germany to collaborate with local colleagues, meet partners and customers, and attend relevant industry events.</p><p><strong>Build your professional network</strong></p><p>Develop relationships with companies, industry professionals and business partners across the DACH region.</p><p><strong>Real responsibility</strong></p><p>Contribute to developing your own market, commercial relationships and partnership opportunities.</p><p><strong>An innovative professional environment</strong></p><p>Learn about cybersecurity, risk management, IT assurance and related professional services.</p><p><strong>Opportunities for students and graduates</strong></p><p>We welcome recent graduates interested in a full-time position and final-year students looking to combine their studies with meaningful part-time work.</p><p><strong>A collaborative team culture</strong></p><p>Become part of a team that shares knowledge, celebrates success and helps each other grow.</p><p><strong>About Securance</strong></p><p>Securance is an international professional services organization specializing in cybersecurity, risk management, IT assurance and related advisory services.</p><p>We help organizations understand risks, strengthen controls and build confidence in their business and technology environments.</p><p>Our international approach combines professional expertise with local market understanding, strategic partnerships and long-term customer relationships.</p><p>As part of our commercial team, you'll learn how to translate complex business challenges into valuable conversations, business opportunities and sustainable partnerships.</p><p><strong>Ready to start your international career?</strong></p><p>If you're German-speaking, internationally minded and excited to develop your skills in sales, business development and partnership management, we'd love to meet you.</p><p><strong>Join our international team in Utrecht. Build relationships across borders. Start your career with Securance.</strong></p><p><strong>Apply now!</strong></p><p><em>Location: Utrecht, The Netherlands. This is an office-based international team position, involving regular business travel to Germany when required. It is not a remote position based in Germany.</em></p><p></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/securance/junior-international-sales-business-development-representative-dach-market-utrecht-25001","tags":["Business Development"],"job_types":["Fixed-term contract (tijdelijk contract/arbeidsovereenkomst voor bepaalde tijd)","entry"],"location":"Utrecht","created_at":1793786467},{"slug":"remote-senior-staff-software-engineer-sap-connectors-462420","company_name":"Fivetran","title":"Senior Staff Software Engineer - SAP Connectors","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are building data pipelines to power the modern data stack for thousands of companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fivetran&#39;s SAP connectors move enterprise data out of SAP and into modern data platforms. We&#39;re looking for an all-round SAP specialist who combines strong ABAP skills with deep knowledge of SAP outbound interfacing. You&#39;ll work on the interfaces and data extraction mechanisms that let Fivetran reliably pull data from SAP ECC and S/4HANA systems, and you&#39;ll help customers and internal teams get the most out of them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will be the SAP specialist within a team of Java developers. Your knowledge and input is crucial to the success of this team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;ABAP programming using traditional SAPGUI as well as Eclipse (or other IDE).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Databases (HANA/Oracle/etc)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cloud environments (AWS/GCP/MS)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;AI tools Claude/Codex/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design, build, and maintain high-performance ABAP components (function modules, classes, CDS views, and enhancements) to drive scalable outbound data extraction from SAP systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own and modernize internal SAP test environments to accelerate feature development for current connectors and upcoming public cloud / BTP integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Architect robust outbound interfaces leveraging OData, standard and generic DataSources, ODP/ODQ delta frameworks, and RFC connections.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Optimize data throughput and reliability across ECC and S/4HANA landscapes by diagnosing and resolving extraction performance bottlenecks and delta synchronization issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Analyze underlying SAP database structures (HANA and traditional DBs) to unlock efficiency gains and streamline data pipeline performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineering, support, and customers to translate complex business requirements into elegant technical architectures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver end-to-end support for enterprise clients by troubleshooting complex connectivity, authorization, and configuration challenges in customer SAP environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Establish technical design standards, interface specifications, and best practice documentation for internal and external knowledge sharing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Evaluate and integrate emerging SAP technologies—including SAP Datasphere and BTP—to keep Fivetran’s connectors at the forefront of modern data integration.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;10+ years of hands-on SAP development experience, with strong ABAP skills (classic and modern ABAP, ABAP OO, ABAP for HANA)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of SAP outbound interfacing:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;OData (v2 and v4): service design, SEGW, performance, and security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;SAP extractors: standard and generic DataSources, delta handling, ODP/ODQ, CDS-based extraction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;RFC: function modules, BAPIs, destinations, and tRFC/qRFC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Solid working knowledge of both SAP ECC and S/4HANA, including the differences in data models and extraction options between them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Good knowledge of databases: SQL, query performance and tuning, SAP HANA, and relational database concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
