0">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">We're looking for a highly motivated, experienced strategy and digital transformation consultant to take the next step in a rapid-growth scale-up environment. You'll play a pivotal role in shaping our clients' future success, providing strategic guidance and overseeing execution across consulting projects.&nbsp;<br></span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#000000">What you’ll be working on</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Leading and managing workstreams from initiation to completion, keeping objectives on time and on budget&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Building and maintaining strong client relationships, understanding business challenges and delivering value-driven solutions&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Conducting in-depth industry and market research, competitive analysis, and benchmarking to identify growth opportunities and shape data-driven digital strategies&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Developing and implementing digital transformation strategies that help clients put technology to work for the business&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Guiding and mentoring a team of consultants, fostering a collaborative, high-performance environment&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Developing actionable recommendations and strategic plans tailored to each client's needs&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Ensuring the quality and accuracy of deliverables, reports, and client presentations&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Supporting business development by identifying potential clients and contributing to proposals&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Staying ahead of industry trends, emerging technologies, and best practices in strategy consulting and digital transformation&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#000000">Who you are</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">4–6 years of experience at a top-tier consulting firm, with a focus on digital and/or tech transformation&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Strong understanding of digital technologies, trends, and their applications in business&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Proven ability to turn quantitative and qualitative analysis into actionable strategy&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Demonstrated leadership experience, with the ability to inspire and guide teams&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Strong project management skills, comfortable running multiple projects at once&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">A client-focused mindset with a passion for delivering exceptional value and impact&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Adaptable and always looking to innovate in evolving business contexts&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Master's degree in business, management, or a related field&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Proficient in Microsoft Office Suite and project management tools&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Excellent communication and presentation skills in English (C1 minimum); Dutch is a plus&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Willing to travel as needed&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#000000">What we offer</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">A competitive compensation package&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">25 days off per year, plus a full week off between Christmas and New Year&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Flexible work from abroad for up to 6 weeks per year&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Pension scheme to help you plan for your future&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Learning &amp; Development budget&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">ClassPass membership&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Access to the latest tools: ChatGPT Pro, Claude, Notion, Sembly, SlideHub and Riverflex's in-house developed software&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Equity share scheme for long-term team members&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW254889075 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">EU-eligible or open to a Dutch highly skilled migrant visa - we sponsor. 30% ruling support available.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><strong><span style="color:#000000">Why join now?</span></strong><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW254889075 BCX0"><span style="color:#000000">Riverflex is at an inflection point. We've built trusted relationships with some of Europe's most complex organisations, and demand for strategy and transformation expertise keeps growing. This isn't a role where you slot into an existing structure - you'll get real ownership from day one, exposure to blue-chip clients, and the chance to help shape how we scale. If you're looking for a place to do your best work and leave a mark, this is it.&nbsp;</span></p> <br> <p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/riverflex/senior-consultant-strategy-transformation-amsterdam-405307","tags":["Strategy"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1793775081},{"slug":"commercial-account-executive-netherlands-amsterdam-210067","company_name":"Horizon3Ai","title":"Commercial Account Executive, Netherlands","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Get to Know Us</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Horizon3 is a fast-growing, remote cybersecurity company dedicated to the mission of enabling organisations to proactively find and fix and verify exploitable attack vectors before criminals exploit them. Our flagship product,  the NodeZeroTM platform, delivers production-safe autonomous pentests and other key assessment operations that scale across the largest internal, external, cloud, and hybrid cloud environments. NodeZero has been adopted by organisations of all sizes, from small educational institutions to government agencies and Global 100 enterprises. It is used by ITOps/SecOps teams, consulting pentesters, and MSSPs and MSPs.  </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a fusion of former U.S. Special Operations cyber operators, startup engineers, and formerly frustrated cybersecurity practitioners. We're committed to helping solve our common security problems: ineffective security tools, false positives resulting in alert fatigue, blind spots, "checkbox” security culture, cybersecurity skills shortage, and the long lead time and expense of hiring outside consultants. Collectively, we are a team of learn it alls, committed to a culture of respect, collaboration, ownership, and results. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>About the role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are hiring for our second Commercial Account Executive to help grow the Commercial business across the Netherlands.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will help grow the Commercial business in your market by building strong relationships, creating new logo momentum, and working closely with partners and the wider team to expand Horizon3’s reach.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for experienced sellers who enjoy building. They should be proactive, thoughtful, and comfortable helping markets develop. They should carry the story well, build trust with customers and partners, and help turn ambition into market presence, new logo growth, and long-term opportunity.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>How we work</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our Commercial team comes together in the Amsterdam hub to collaborate, learn from each other, and build community around the Commercial business.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At the same time, we work for and in our local markets. That means staying close to customers, partners, and market activity. Travel in-region is part of the role.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">In each market, the Commercial seller, Enterprise seller, Partner Manager, Sales Engineer, and Commercial leader may report into different leaders, but they share collective responsibility for helping the market work well and for making Horizon3 successful in the region.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What you will do</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Grow the Commercial business in your assigned markets through strong customer engagement, partner collaboration, and good market execution</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create new logo momentum and build pipeline in a way that fits the local market</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and manage opportunities with good judgement, clear ownership, and strong follow-through</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with partners, distributors, MSSPs, Enterprise sellers, Partner Managers, and Sales Engineers to help the market work well</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to partner and territory plans and help turn those plans into action</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work across Marketing, Channel, Sales Engineering, Sales Ops, Deal Desk, and leadership to move business forward</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring useful market feedback back into the business</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Represent Horizon3 well with customers and partners</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keep building your capability, product knowledge, and commercial effectiveness over time</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What success looks like</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Success in this role is about helping the market grow and contributing to a strong Commercial motion in-region.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be successful if you:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create new logo momentum and help grow the Commercial segment in your markets</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build strong relationships with customers, partners, and internal teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage opportunities well and help move business forward with consistency and ownership</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Become productive quickly and continue to grow in impact over time</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring useful market insight back into the business</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What we are looking for</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for experienced Commercial sellers who are comfortable working in a fast-paced environment and helping build markets.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong candidates will bring:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">More than 4 years of closing experience in IT or cybersecurity sales</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in Commercial or mid-market sales, ideally in more than one market or in a regionally complex environment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confidence working with partners, distributors, MSSPs, and cross-functional teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Good commercial judgement and the ability to navigate opportunities with customers, partners, and internal stakeholders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong ownership, follow-through, and comfort with visibility and accountability</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curiosity, coachability, and a desire to keep learning and improving</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort working in a scaling business where structure is still being built</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in Dutch, plus strong English</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A proactive, builder mindset: someone with a point of view who stays close to the market, works well with customers, partners, and the wider team, and looks for better ways to increase reach, efficiency, and impact</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Why this role matters</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a chance to help shape how Commercial grows across EMEA.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you want a role where you can help build markets, work closely with partners and customers, and play a meaningful part in how a new category develops in-region, this is that role.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Compensation and Values</strong></p><p style="m