herlands-leiden-342208","company_name":"Tandem Health","title":"Senior Account Executive - Netherlands","description":"<h1>Build something monumental for Healthcare!<br /></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Tandem Health we’re reimagining healthcare by putting clinicians first. Our platform - designed by clinicians, for clinicians - is built on deep insight into real-world pain points, with intuitive medical notes and workflows that truly support patient care.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re a fast-scaling health-tech company backed by top investors and expanding globally. We move fast, stay curious, and believe building something that matters starts with an extraordinary team. If you're passionate about impact and innovation, we'd love to meet you!</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Every day, physicians across The Netherlands lose hours to documentation instead of patients. Tandem gives that time back - and clinicians actually use it. That’s rare in health tech, and it changes the way you sell: you’re not convincing people they have a problem, you’re showing them a better way to work.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re building the Dutch market properly - a real product with real pull, backed to win, and a sales team being built right now. If you want to contribute something being built for healthcare in the right way, this is the room to be in.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About Tandem</strong></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Tandem builds AI that gives time back to physicians, therapists and nurses. Our team of clinicians, psychologists and AI engineers builds close to the reality of care - pairing modern technology with medical expertise to cut administrative load and free up time for patients.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• 200+ people, founded August 2023</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• $160m raised, backed by leading European VCs (EQT, Northzone, Kinnevik) and angels from companies like OpenAI</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">• Product already live and in daily clinical use across Europe in +10,000 healthcare organisations (1500 in The Netherlands)</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the role</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Tandem Health, we’re building a clinician copilot that gives time back to care teams so clinicians can focus on patients. You'll be dealing with complex customers to win them over and expand our market share in the Netherlands. </p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you’ll do</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the full cycle: qualify, demo, negotiate, close</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run a high throughput of meetings while keeping every conversation consultative, not transactional</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Present the product to clinicians and decision-makers and translate their documentation pain into a clear reason to act</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage relationships through to a live, happy customer, working closely with your SDR and MedOps</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stay engaged in your customer relationships long term, update and upsell them on new developments and features</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Feed what you hear in the market back to product</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Represent Tandem at events across the region</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you bring</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">5+ years of full-cycle B2B sales, previous experience in field sales, door-to-door prospecting, or territory-based commercial roles.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of hitting and beating quota - and you can prove it with concrete numbers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The consultative, lead-from-the-front selling style described in “How we sell”</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Native-level Dutch and C1/C2 English</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience selling to healthcare professionals (clinics, private practices, care providers) or working in regulated environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in digital products, SaaS, or technology that improves professional workflows.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How we sell (our culture)</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We hire salespeople who lead, not ones who wait for a script:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You bring a point of view - you help a clinician see their documentation burden in a new light, instead of listing features.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You tailor the message to whoever is across the table: practice owner, chief physician, or administration.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You lead the conversation and put the hard topics - including price - on the table early, rather than hoping they don’t come up.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are relentless about results and back what you say with numbers.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What we offer</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive salary, reviewed as you grow, plus stock options</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">30 days of holiday</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Paid parental leave</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">€1,000 annual health &amp; wellbeing budget, plus mental-health support whenever you need it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A real learning budget and internal growth paths - build your career without leaving Tandem</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fully AI native company - let our agents do the grunt work</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Two company off-sites a year, plus a team budget for the things that bring you closer</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">State of the art office in the heart of Leiden, your choice of IT equipment</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Location &amp; way of working</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Netherlands-based · Hybrid · Fully Leiden-based preferred</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Compensation</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive base + uncapped OTE</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Applying</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We building a team that reflects the world we want to change, and we welcome applicants of every background.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We adopt a continuous selection process, so please make sure to apply with your CV in English.</p><h1>Culture at Tandem<br /></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Tandem, we move fast, think big, and take ownership. We're a high-performing, diverse team with a shared drive to change the future of healthcare - and we’re just getting started.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our culture is built on action, ambition, and learning. You'll be trusted to take the lead, challenge yourself, and make an impact from day one. We believe real growth happens when you're stretched, supported, and surrounded by smart, passionate teammates who want to win together.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Even though we’re spread across countries, we come together often in Sweden for team meetings, social events, and offsites - blending global reach with real human connection.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We hire for talent, potential, and attitude - valuing different backgrounds and fresh perspectives. Great ideas come from everywhere, and we’re building a team that reflects the world we want to change.<br /><br /><em>Tandem handles sensitive patient data and will conduct a background check before hiring any candidate.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/tandem-health/senior-account-executive-netherlands-leiden-342208","tags":["Commercial"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Leiden","created_at":1793774411},{"slug":"power-platform-and-azure-devops-expert-remote-from-eu-amsterdam-110494","company_name":"AlmavivA de Belgique","title":"Power Platform and Azure DevOps Expert - remote from EU","description":"<p>This is an experienced architect-level position. The appointed resource will be expected to serve as the Power Platform administrator, administering and supporting approximately 100 Power Platform environments. A significant part of the role will involve establishing guidelines and providing direction to approximately 150 developers across multiple teams and throughout the organization. At least 2 years of demonstrable experience is required for each of the following mandatory requirements.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>REQUIREMENTS</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Bachelor's or master's degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Software Engineering or a related field.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Proven experience as a Power Platform architect, administrator or DevOps lead in an enterprise environment.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Demonstratable experience of leading multiple teams.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Deep practical knowledge of Microsoft Dynamics 365 and the Power Platform suite (Power Apps, Power Automate, Power Pages).</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Strong experience with Azure DevOps, including pipeline creation, variable groups, service connections, and release management.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Strong experience with Git-based ALM for Power Platform, including solution unpacking/packing and automated versioning.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills with a proactive mindset toward governance and automation.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Effective communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work closely with cross-functional technical and business teams.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Preferred certifications (<strong>non-mandatory</strong>):</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">•&nbsp;&nbsp; Microsoft Certified: PL-600 (Power Platform Solution Architect)</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">•&nbsp;&nbsp; Microsoft Certified: PL-400 (Power Platform Developer)</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">•&nbsp;&nbsp; Microsoft Certified: AZ-400 (DevOps Engineer Expert)</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">•&nbsp;&nbsp; Microsoft Certified: AZ-104 (Azure Administrator)</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Extensive hands-on experience administering enterprise-scale Power Platform environments across a full DTAP pipeline (DEV, TEST, ACC/UAT, PRE-PROD, PROD).</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Experience designing enterprise-scale governance and ALM strategies, including DLP policies, managed environments, and environment groups.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Demonstrated expertise in Dynamics 365 solution architecture, including advanced knowledge of solution layering, dependencies, patches, upgrades, and holding solutions.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Proven experience decomposing large, monolithic Dynamics 365 solutions with multiple inter-dependencies into modular, independently deployable units.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Experience designing and operating Git-based ALM workflows for Power Platform, including full solution unpacking/packing, automated versioning, and repository-only deployments.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Experience building and maintaining Azure DevOps CI/CD pipelines for Power Platform solution deployment, connection reference activation, and flow management.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Experience managing Dynamics 365 security, including security roles, business units, application users.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;"><strong>Highly valued but not mandatory:</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Experience integrating Azure Key Vault with Azure DevOps pipelines for secure credential, secret, and certificate management.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Experience deploying master and configuration data across environments using Configuration Migration Tool, PAC CLI, KingswaySoft SSIS Integration Toolkit, or equivalent tooling.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Experience with enterprise Dynamics 365 implementations (&gt;500 users) in regulated environments requiring strict auditability and controlled deployments.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Experience managing Power Pages and Dynamics 365 AI features security, including user experience profiles, table permissions, and portal web roles.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;"><strong><em>Power Platform Administration &amp; Governance</em></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Administers multiple Power Platform environments, covering strategy design, lifecycle management, environment groups, and managed environments governance.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Designs and implements Data Loss Prevention (DLP) policies with environmentspecific governance, connector classification, and compliance best practices.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Establishes and maintains Power Platform governance standards, development and deployment standards, and monitors platform usage, capacity, and health.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">&nbsp;</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;"><strong>Dynamics 365 Solution Architecture &amp; ALM</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Demonstrates expert understanding of managed vs unmanaged solutions, solution segmentation, dependencies, patches, upgrades, holding solutions, and solution layering concepts.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Identifies and resolves solution layer conflicts, customization precedence issues, and dependency chains across environments.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Analyses large Dynamics 365 implementations, identifies cross-solution dependencies, and decomposes monolithic solutions into modular deployment units to minimise risk.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Manages multi-team development environments, multiple release streams, feature branching strategies, hotfix releases, and parallel development approaches.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;"><strong>Source Control &amp; Git Integration</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Manages Azure Repos with branching strategies, pull request governance, and code review processes for Power Platform development.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Implements solution unpacking/packing using Power Platform Build Tools and PAC CLI, ensuring fully repository-based deployments with no manual production releases.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;"><strong>Deployment Automation</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Designs and maintains CI/CD pipelines and release orchestration for environment promotion of Power Platform solutions.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Automates deployment of Dynamics 365 solutions, Power Apps, Power Pages, Power Automate flows, environment variables, and connection references.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Automates connection reference deployment and activation, environmentspecific configuration, post-deployment validation, and connector authentication handling.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Manages automated activation of Power Automate flows, environment migration, service account configuration, and deployment validation.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;"><strong>Master Data &amp; Environment Configuration Deployment </strong>(Highly valued but not mandatory)</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Deploys configuration data, reference data, lookup data, security configuration, and application configuration across environments.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Uses Configuration Migration Tool, PAC CLI, deployment settings files, KingswaySoft SSIS Integration Toolkit or other similar tools for deployment automation including .</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Synchronises master data across environments, maintains DTAP consistency, automates configuration deployment, and prevents manual configuration drift.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;"><strong>Security &amp; Access Management</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Applies deep knowledge of Dynamics 365 security roles, teams, business units, field-level security, record ownership models, and hierarchical security.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Manages service principals, application users, non-interactive access, API authentication, and least-privilege access models.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Configures Power Pages web roles, table permissions, authentication providers, external user access, API security, and portal governance. (valued but not mandatory)</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Conducts security reviews, designs least-privileged access solutions, troubleshoots access issues, and supports audit and compliance requirements.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;"><strong>Azure DevOps CI/CD Pipelines</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Builds CI/CD pipelines from scratch for Power Platform deployments, optimises existing pipelines, troubleshoots deployment failures, and standardises deployment frameworks.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Integrates Power Platform pipelines with Azure AD, service principals, Key Vault, and monitoring platforms within Azure DevOps. (valued but not mandatory)</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;"><strong>Azure Key Vault Integration (valued but not mandatory)</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Manages secure credential storage, certificates, managed identities, and service principals via Azure Key Vault.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;">Impleme